cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its prompts, please cite the working-notes paper."
title: "ELiRF-UPV at EXIST 2026: Multimodal Fusion and Few-Shot LLMs for Sexism Detection in Memes and Videos"
abstract: >-
  Code, prompts and configurations for the ELiRF-UPV participation in the EXIST 2026
  shared task at CLEF 2026, covering all six subtasks over memes (Task 2) and short
  TikTok videos (Task 3) under the Learning with Disagreements paradigm.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
